WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Start with the full legal name in the
source document.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:08.160
Compare the jurisdiction and the
registration number where one is
available.

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:13.360
Check the date before treating a filing
as evidence of today’s directors or
ownership.
